{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47016","headline":"祈真坛 · 齐己","name":"祈真坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉瓮瑶坛二三级，学仙弟子参差入。\n霓旌队仗下不下，松桧森森天露湿。\n殿前寒气束香云，朝祈暮祷玄元君。\n茫茫俗骨醉更昏，楼台十二遥崑仑。\n崑仑纵广一万二千里，中有五色云霞五色水。\n何当断慾便飞去，不要九转神丹换精髓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}